<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-INJURED HAGI TO MISS MACEDONIA CLASH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INJURED HAGI TO MISS MACEDONIA CLASH.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania captain Gheorghe Hagi will miss Saturday's World Cup qualifier against Macedonia because of a strained right thigh.</p>
<p>Mallorca midfielder Costel Galca was called in as his replacement for the game in Skopje.</p>
